  {
    "key": "03-cafe-behavior-tree",
    "title": "咖啡厅行为树 · 实际运行分支",
    "description": "ReactiveFallback 按编号顺序选择，前面的有效分支可打断后面的运行分支。模板中旧概率视线分支仍存在，但原生宿主调用树时关闭 trackingEnabled，实际视线由 CafeAttention 处理。",
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "root",
        "label": "ReactiveFallback\n每次 tick 按 1 → 6 检查",
        "kind": "decision"
      },
      {
        "id": "drag",
        "label": "1 · ReactiveSequence\nIsDragging → LoopAnimation\nFormation_Pickup",
        "kind": "state"
      },
      {
        "id": "click",
        "label": "2 · Sequence\nHasPendingClick → PlayAnimation\nCafe_Reaction；消费一次点击",
        "kind": "state"
      },
      {
        "id": "home",
        "label": "3 · ReturnHome\n散步后恢复输入且未开启位置跟随\nCafe_Walk；直线返回本轮起点",
        "kind": "state"
      },
      {
        "id": "legacy",
        "label": "4 · 旧视线 Sequence（未启用）\nActiveInputChance → FaceCursor\n原生宿主 trackingEnabled=false",
        "kind": "inactive"
      },
      {
        "id": "wander",
        "label": "5 · ReactiveSequence\nUserInactive 达标 + 允许散步",
        "kind": "decision"
      },
      {
        "id": "cooldown",
        "label": "Sequence\nIdleCooldownReady\n间隔 × 随机时间幅度",
        "kind": "state"
      },
      {
        "id": "walk",
        "label": "WalkRandom → Cafe_Walk\n8 方向加权选择；距离带随机\n上行权重 0.4、路程倍率 2.5",
        "kind": "state"
      },
      {
        "id": "idle",
        "label": "6 · LoopAnimation\nCafe_Idle\n纯待机动画速度 75%",
        "kind": "state"
      },
      {
        "id": "finish",
        "label": "单次动作 / 返回 / 散步完成\n重置冷却，重新从根节点评估",
        "kind": "state"
      },
      {
        "id": "cap",
        "label": "导入时按能力修剪\n无 Reaction：移除点击分支\n无 Walk：移除返程和散步分支",
        "kind": "note"
      },
      {
        "id": "override",
        "label": "宿主覆盖层（见移动/视线图）\n输入活跃 + 位置跟随会抑制随机散步\n跟随仍以基础 Idle 为宿主状态",
        "kind": "note"
      },
      {
        "id": "fallback",
        "label": "XML 每 0.5s 检查更新\n无效更新保留旧树\n首次无效 / 执行异常 → SafeIdle",
        "kind": "note"
      }
    ],
